  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_01",
      "hash64": "6ED1B9A3196FDDD3",
      "text": "You’re [VAR 0x0100(0000)] or whatever, right?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_02",
      "hash64": "6ED1BAA3196FDF86",
      "text": "Let me guess—you want to pair up with one of us\\npoor, lonely Blueberry students?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_03",
      "hash64": "6ED1BBA3196FE139",
      "text": "Gosh, it’s so sweet of you to go out of your way\\nlike that. What would we ever do without you?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_04",
      "hash64": "6ED1BCA3196FE2EC",
      "text": "Wait, but you’re the one who came to talk to us.\\nWhat are you, some kinda weirdo?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_05",
      "hash64": "6ED1BDA3196FE49F",
      "text": "Oh yeah. So my little brother here has been\\nall googly-eyed over you since yesterday.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_06",
      "hash64": "6ED1BEA3196FE652",
      "text": "He wouldn’t stop talking about you—even at\\nhome. I seriously couldn’t get him to shut up.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_brother_01",
      "hash64": "02D00402D2FE79CF",
      "text": "S-Sis! What’re you tellin’ h[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]imer that for, dummy![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_07",
      "hash64": "6ED1BFA3196FE805",
      "text": "HEY! Watch who you call “dummy,” if you know\\nwhat’s good for you![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_brother_02",
      "hash64": "02D00502D2FE7B82",
      "text": "Aw man...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_08",
      "hash64": "6ED1C0A3196FE9B8",
      "text": "Look at him, being all shy...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_09",
      "hash64": "6ED1C1A3196FEB6B",
      "text": "See, my brother’s no good at talking to people.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_10",
      "hash64": "6ED53EA31972F5A9",
      "text": "He’d probably never work up the nerve to ask\\nyou himself, but he’d really like a battle with you.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_11",
      "hash64": "6ED53DA31972F3F6",
      "text": "C’mon, please? Just have a battle with my\\nbrother, would you?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_12",
      "hash64": "6ED53CA31972F243",
      "text": "Huh? What’s that? I couldn’t hear you.\\c\\nWhen you’ve cleared your throat of whatever\\nthat was and are ready to say yes, lemme know.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_13",
      "hash64": "6ED53BA31972F090",
      "text": "Well, what do you know—turns out you’re sorta\\nnice. This’ll make my brother real happy.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_14",
      "hash64": "6ED542A31972FC75",
      "text": "Chin up, Kiki!\\c\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)] says [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]she’ll battle you![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_brother_03",
      "hash64": "02D00602D2FE7D35",
      "text": "What?![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_brother_04",
      "hash64": "02CFFF02D2FE7150",
      "text": "W-wowzers, really?! You don’t mind?![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_15",
      "hash64": "6ED541A31972FAC2",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0201)]HShe doesn’t mind a bit.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0201"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_16",
      "hash64": "6ED540A31972F90F",
      "text": "Get to your positions, you two. Everybody else,\\nclear out. Make some space![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_brother_05",
      "hash64": "02D00002D2FE7303",
      "text": "I-I got this![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_student1_01",
      "hash64": "F5FB6C36E5761431",
      "text": "Good show!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "0F1D3B6D4E12391F",
      "text": "Nicely done, kids! Nothing like a friendly battle\\nto get to know someone![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_brother_06",
      "hash64": "02D00102D2FE74B6",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]W-wowzers! You sure are strong,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_brother_07",
      "hash64": "02D00202D2FE7669",
      "text": "That was some kinda battle!\\c\\nI bet you’re something else when you’re not\\nholdin’ back, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_17",
      "hash64": "6ED53FA31972F75C",
      "text": "You really aren’t half bad. Kiki’s nearly as strong\\nas I am, you know.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_brother_08",
      "hash64": "02D00B02D2FE85B4",
      "text": "I dunno about that...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_18",
      "hash64": "6ED546A319730341",
      "text": "This orienteering thing... We’re supposed to\\ngroup up in pairs, right?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_19",
      "hash64": "6ED545A31973018E",
      "text": "You should go ahead and pair up with Kiki, then.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_brother_09",
      "hash64": "02D00C02D2FE8767",
      "text": "What?! No, Sis, don’t—![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_20",
      "hash64": "6ED844A3197535B2",
      "text": "Don’t what? It’s not like we can pair up. Or were\\nyou hoping to partner with some other rando\\r\\noutsider instead of [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_brother_10",
      "hash64": "02D30902D300B825",
      "text": "Well...no, but... Aw man...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_21",
      "hash64": "6ED845A319753765",
      "text": "Don’t worry. He’s just being shy.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_22",
      "hash64": "6ED842A31975324C",
      "text": "I’ll go find some chump to pair up with too.\\nWatch out for my little bro, you.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
